  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="14.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:CHnCor">CHn cor</ref> 14.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="14.1" corresp="#wit-h"><pb n="282" ed="#robertson"/>Et si quis inde aliquid retinuerit, ille super quem inventum fuerit graviter mihi emendabit.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-h"><pb n="283" ed="#robertson"/>But if anyone shall thereafter retain anything, he in whose possession it is found shall pay heavy compensation to me.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 282–283 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
      </div>
    </body>
